{% comment %}
  ==================================================================
  CUSTOM TESTIMONIALS
  Ported from gs-shopify-v3 sections/custom-testimonials.liquid
  ==================================================================
  "WHAT PATRIOTS ARE SAYING" - the review carousel near the bottom of
  the homepage. Five testimonials in templates/index.json.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  INVALID SCHEMA JSON
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  v3's schema had a trailing comma:
      { "type": "text", "id": "customer_jd", "label": "From", }
  Same defect as the v1 text-scroller. Fixed.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  COLOUR SCHEME PROPERTIES THAT DO NOT EXIST IN DAWN
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  v3 read scheme settings directly inside CSS:
      section.settings.color_scheme.settings.heading
      section.settings.color_scheme.settings.border
      section.settings.color_scheme.settings.rating_color
      section.settings.color_scheme.settings.text

  v3's schemes defined heading, border and rating_color. DAWN'S DO NOT -
  Dawn exposes only background, text, button, button_label,
  secondary_button_label and shadow. Three of those four would resolve
  to empty and emit `color: ;`, which is invalid and silently dropped.

  Now driven by the token bridge's CSS custom properties, which are
  defined for every scheme:
      heading      -> --headingColor
      text         -> --textColor
      border       -> --borderColor
      rating_color -> --ratingStarColor

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  MULTI-INSTANCE BUG
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  The Swiper init used document.querySelector (singular) for the slider
  AND for both arrow buttons. A second testimonials section anywhere on
  the page would not initialise, and its arrows would drive the FIRST
  section instead. There was also no null check before `new Swiper()`.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  SWIPER REMOVED
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  Replaced with CSS scroll-snap, consistent with the swatch port.
  Arrow behaviour reuses assets/gs-swatch-scroller.js, which is generic
  despite its name - it drives anything marked with data-swatch-scroller
  / data-swatch-track / data-swatch-scroll.

  CLEANUP DEBT: that file should be renamed gs-scroller.js now that a
  second component uses it. Deliberately not renamed here to avoid
  breaking the script tag while it is still being wired up.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  OTHER FIXES
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  1. DUPLICATE RULE. The mobile media query contained
         .custom-testimonials-container { padding: 36px 0; }
         .custom-testimonials-container { padding: 40px 0; }
     back to back. The first was dead on arrival.

  2. HARDCODED COLOUR AND FONT. .custom-jd forced color #000000 and
     font-family 'Helvetica' regardless of scheme, so on a dark scheme
     the attribution line was invisible. Now inherits.

  3. MAGIC WIDTH. .custom-comment had max-width: 228px on mobile, which
     truncates longer testimonials into a narrow column. Removed.

  4. STAR RATING ACCESSIBILITY. Five stars are drawn with a CSS ::before
     containing literal star characters. Some screen readers announce
     generated content, so the element is now aria-hidden. Note these
     stars are decorative and always show five - they are not tied to
     any real rating data.

  5. GLOBAL CSS. Class names like .custom-comment and .custom-name were
     declared globally, once per instance. Namespaced and moved to an
     asset. NOTE: templates/index.json carries a custom_css rule
     targeting .custom-comment - that rule will no longer match. It set
     font-size 20px / weight 400, which is already the default here.

  6. != empty changed to != blank throughout.

  All schema setting IDs are byte-for-byte identical to v3.
  ==================================================================
{% endcomment %}

{{ 'gs-custom-testimonials.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
  <div
    class="gs-testimonials color-{{ section.settings.color_scheme }}"
    style="
      --gt-align: {{ section.settings.content_alignment | default: 'center' }};
      --gt-pad-desktop: {{ section.settings.content_spacing_desktop }}px;
      --gt-pad-mobile: {{ section.settings.content_spacing_mobile }}px;
      {%- if section.settings.enable_content_border -%}
        --gt-border-width: {{ section.settings.content_border_width }}px;
      {%- else -%}
        --gt-border-width: 0px;
      {%- endif -%}
    "
  >
    {%- if section.settings.section_heading != blank -%}
      <h2 class="gs-testimonials__heading">{{ section.settings.section_heading }}</h2>
    {%- endif -%}

    <div class="gs-testimonials__scroller" data-swatch-scroller>
      <button
        type="button"
        class="gs-testimonials__btn"
        data-swatch-scroll="prev"
        aria-label="{{ 'general.slider.previous_slide' | t | default: 'Previous' }}"
        hidden
      >
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
          <path d="M15 4 L7 12 L15 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        </svg>
      </button>

      <ul class="gs-testimonials__track" data-swatch-track>
        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          <li class="gs-testimonials__item" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            {%- if section.settings.enable_star_rating -%}
              <div class="gs-testimonials__rating" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- if block.settings.testimonial_heading != blank -%}
              <h3 class="gs-testimonials__item-heading">{{ block.settings.testimonial_heading }}</h3>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- if block.settings.comment_text != blank -%}
              <p class="gs-testimonials__comment">{{ block.settings.comment_text }}</p>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- if block.settings.customer_name != blank -%}
              <p class="gs-testimonials__name">{{ block.settings.customer_name }}</p>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- if block.settings.customer_jd != blank -%}
              <p class="gs-testimonials__jd">{{ block.settings.customer_jd }}</p>
            {%- endif -%}
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>

      <button
        type="button"
        class="gs-testimonials__btn"
        data-swatch-scroll="next"
        aria-label="{{ 'general.slider.next_slide' | t | default: 'Next' }}"
        hidden
      >
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
          <path d="M9 4 L17 12 L9 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Custom testimonials",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section gs-testimonials-section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "header", "content": "General" },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "section_heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "WHAT PATRIOTS ARE SAYING"
    },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Settings" },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "enable_content_border",
      "label": "Display border around content",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "content_border_width",
      "label": "Border width",
      "min": 1,
      "max": 10,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "enable_star_rating",
      "label": "Display star rating",
      "info": "Decorative. Always shows five stars; not tied to review data.",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text_alignment",
      "id": "content_alignment",
      "label": "Content alignment",
      "default": "center"
    },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Colors" },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "Color scheme",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Spacing" },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "content_spacing_desktop",
      "label": "Content spacing (desktop)",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 150,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 50
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "content_spacing_mobile",
      "label": "Content spacing (mobile)",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 75,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 25
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "testimonial",
      "name": "Testimonial",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text", "id": "testimonial_heading", "label": "Testimonial heading" },
        {
          "type": "textarea",
          "id": "comment_text",
          "label": "Testimonial text",
          "default": "This is a wonderful product!"
        },
        { "type": "text", "id": "customer_name", "label": "Customer name", "default": "John Doe" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "customer_jd", "label": "From" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Custom testimonials",
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "testimonial" },
        { "type": "testimonial" },
        { "type": "testimonial" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
